Elara: I'll wall it in! BARRIER — I'm sealing the exits!
Kaelen: It hit the wall! The debris is blocking the exit — it's got nowhere to run now!
System: [Boar trapped against the barrier!]\n[POGO STRIKE available! Press DOWN (S) while airborne!]
